rows=[
('raw::342',1082,8,'theory','I_force_motion;VII_magnetic_field;VI_electric_field','Supplied circulation/magnetic analogy/advection, pressure and gravity balance, kinetic-energy and momentum integration, electric force and image-boundary geometry','The statement supplies quantized circulation, superposition with explicit magnetic-wire equivalence, vortex advection and loop energy/momentum. Free-surface shapes follow ordinary centripetal/hydrostatic balance. Charged-ring velocity follows energy power F*v together with momentum rate F and given U(R),P(R), not an unsupplied canonical Hamiltonian law. Wall boundary is explicitly zero normal flow; image vortices and subsequent energy conservation/ODE geometry use the supplied field model. No microscopic helium theory or unsupplied specialized fluid constitutive law controls the task.'),
('raw::343',1090,6,'theory','I_force_motion','Newtonian gravitational scattering, impact parameter and collision flux, energy loss and orbital shrinkage; supplied gravitational-radiation power and merger cutoff','General information explicitly restricts motion to Newtonian point masses. Weak scattering is ordinary impulse, slingshot speed assumption is given, collision rate follows particle flux. Both gravitational-wave power with quadrupole definition and gravitational radius cutoff are explicitly supplied. The final three-stage evolution is energy balance and integration; no GR field equation, spacetime metric or unsupplied black-hole physics required.'),
('raw::344',1099,6,'theory','I_force_motion;VII_magnetic_field;VIII_induction','Rigid-body angular momentum/energy and precession geometry, residual-fuel dissipation minimum, Faraday induction and magnetic moment/torque, body-frame differentiation and averaged relaxation','Angular-momentum components and angular-velocity vector addition are explicitly given. Free precession follows energy/angular-momentum conservation and vector projection. Residual fuel needs only internal-force energy minimization, not a sloshing model. Shell eddy currents follow Faraday/Ohm integration with self-inductance neglected; geomagnetic dipole field is supplied. Changing field in the rotating frame is trigonometric differentiation, followed by torque and ordinary averaged first-order evolution.'),
('raw::345',1106,19,'experimental','X_wave_optics;IX_em_oscillations_waves','Grating diffraction, supplied Bragg-Snell/porosity/spectral-width models, optical measurements, linearization/fits and supplied layered-reflection table','The entire A-E experiment supplies Bragg-Snell interference, dry/wet effective-index formulas and spectral-width relation. Final structure identification uses explicitly given phase/intensity sum and the complete candidate/table appendix, not unsupplied band-structure/transfer-matrix theory. Main work is apparatus alignment, diffraction angles, intensity measurement, fitting and data/model comparison. X,Y,Z and A-E are internal tasks of ONE20-point experiment, not separate top-level problems.')]
