c.execute('update units set source_quality_notes=? where screening_unit_id=?',('Official1115p2 B1 uses650nm while original1106p5 lists659nm and keyp7 uses659nm. This numerical source inconsistency is retained/disclosed, not treated as a scope prerequisite. Actual originalp19 provides indispensable candidate structure diagrams/table; contestants produce measurements, no external fixed dataset specified.','raw::345'))
